{"tier": "glm-5.2", "verse": 10, "ref": "2-chronicles 10:10", "book": "2-chronicles", "lang": "sv", "chapter": 10, "translation": "Och de unga männen som hade vuxit upp ⟨אתו⟩ med honom talade ⟨אתו⟩ till honom och sade: Så skall du säga till folket som talade till dig och sade: Din fader gjorde ⟨את⟩ vårt ok tungt, men du — gör det lindrigare för oss. Så skall du tala till dem: Mitt lillfinger är tjockare än min faders länder.", "tokens": [{"surface": "וידברו", "gloss": "Och de talade"}, {"surface": "אתו", "gloss": "⟨אתו⟩"}, {"surface": "הילדים", "gloss": "de unga männen"}, {"surface": "אשר", "gloss": "som"}, {"surface": "גדלו", "gloss": "hade vuxit upp"}, {"surface": "אתו", "gloss": "⟨אתו⟩"}, {"surface": "לאמר", "gloss": "och sade"}, {"surface": "כה", "gloss": "så"}, {"surface": "תאמר", "gloss": "skall du säga"}, {"surface": "לעם", "gloss": "till folket"}, {"surface": "אשר", "gloss": "som"}, {"surface": "דברו", "gloss": "talade"}, {"surface": "אליך", "gloss": "till dig"}, {"surface": "לאמר", "gloss": "och sade"}, {"surface": "אביך", "gloss": "din fader"}, {"surface": "הכביד", "gloss": "gjorde tungt"}, {"surface": "את", "gloss": "⟨את⟩", "marks": "vårt ok"}, {"surface": "עלנו", "gloss": "vårt ok"}, {"surface": "ואתה", "gloss": "men du"}, {"surface": "הקל", "gloss": "gör lindrigare"}, {"surface": "מעלינו", "gloss": "för oss"}, {"surface": "כה", "gloss": "så"}, {"surface": "תאמר", "gloss": "skall du tala"}, {"surface": "אלהם", "gloss": "till dem"}, {"surface": "קטני", "gloss": "mitt lillfinger"}, {"surface": "עבה", "gloss": "är tjockare"}, {"surface": "ממתני", "gloss": "än länderna"}, {"surface": "אבי", "gloss": "av min fader"}], "timestamp": "2026-09-17T21:00:05.645196863Z", "model": "glm-5.3"}